<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - DLJ started by Goldman.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - DLJ started by Goldman.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs started coverage of Donaldson Lufkin &amp; Jenrette with a market outperform rating, a Goldman source said.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 7/8 to 33-7/8.</p>
</text>
